msgstr "Raiders of the desert roads who prey on villages and travellers. A bandit raises his blade before he strikes — step back or roll behind him while it is up, then punish."

msgid "A lean desert hunter that circles and lunges with a quick bite. Its wind-up is short, so watch for the crouch and dash out of the lunge."
msgstr "A lean desert hunter that circles and lunges with a quick bite. Its wind-up is short, so watch for the crouch and dash out of the lunge."

msgid "Armoured from the front: blows to its shell do little, and a stun will not stop its sting. Its wind-up is long — roll behind it and strike its back."
msgstr "Armoured from the front: blows to its shell do little, and a stun will not stop its sting. Its wind-up is long — roll behind it and strike its back."

msgid "A hulking golem of brass and sandstone with a cage on its back — the Laboratory's catcher of people. Its blows are slow and heavy: roll out of the sweep, jump over the shockwave of its slam, and keep hitting — only a long chain breaks its stance."
msgstr "A hulking golem of brass and sandstone with a cage on its back — the Laboratory's catcher of people. Its blows are slow and heavy: roll out of the sweep, jump over the shockwave of its slam, and keep hitting — only a long chain breaks its stance."

msgid "A burning spirit on a tail of smoke and flame, born in the Laboratory's cells. It claws up close and hurls fire from afar; a glowing mark on the floor means a pillar of fire is coming — step off it. Wounded, it fights faster and throws twice."
msgstr "A burning spirit on a tail of smoke and flame, born in the Laboratory's cells. It claws up close and hurls fire from afar; a glowing mark on the floor means a pillar of fire is coming — step off it. Wounded, it fights faster and throws twice."

