msgid "Move with {move} and jump with {jump}. Press {attack} to attack. When a prompt appears over a person or an object, press {interact} to talk, open or pick it up."
msgstr "Move with {move} and jump with {jump}. Press {attack} to attack. When a prompt appears over a person or an object, press {interact} to talk, open or pick it up."

msgid "The minimap in the top right shows the rooms around you. Open the full map to see everything you have explored so far; while it is open, {move} moves the view and you stand still."
msgstr "The minimap in the top right shows the rooms around you. Open the full map to see everything you have explored so far; while it is open, {move} moves the view and you stand still."

msgid "Look for save points along the way. Step up to one and choose a save slot — there are four. To pick up where you left off, choose Continue on the title screen."
msgstr "Look for save points along the way. Step up to one and choose a save slot — there are four. To pick up where you left off, choose Continue on the title screen."

msgid "The Journal in the game menu follows the story. Quests lists each part of the Prologue with its objectives; Characters keeps the people you have met; the Bestiary records the enemies you have met and killed."
msgstr "The Journal in the game menu follows the story. Quests lists each part of the Prologue with its objectives; Characters keeps the people you have met; the Bestiary records the enemies you have met and killed."

msgid "Move with {move}. Press {jump} to jump. {dodge} dashes — twice in a row, even in the air."
msgstr "Move with {move}. Press {jump} to jump. {dodge} dashes — twice in a row, even in the air."

msgid "Training 1 of 4. Press {attack} three times quickly: the third swing staggers. While you learn, neither of you can fall. {cutscene_skip} skips the training."
msgstr "Training 1 of 4. Press {attack} three times quickly: the third swing staggers. While you learn, neither of you can fall. {cutscene_skip} skips the training."

msgid "Training 2 of 4. When his weapon glints, dash through the blow with {dodge} or hold {block} to take it on your guard. A red glint cannot be blocked: dodge it."
msgstr "Training 2 of 4. When his weapon glints, dash through the blow with {dodge} or hold {block} to take it on your guard. A red glint cannot be blocked: dodge it."

msgid "Training 3 of 4. A yellow glint means a blow you can parry: tap {block} just as it lands. No damage, he reels, and your next attack is a heavy riposte."
msgstr "Training 3 of 4. A yellow glint means a blow you can parry: tap {block} just as it lands. No damage, he reels, and your next attack is a heavy riposte."

msgid "Training 4 of 4. Press {heavy_attack} while he is not swinging: a slow wind-up, then a blow that breaks his guard."
msgstr "Training 4 of 4. Press {heavy_attack} while he is not swinging: a slow wind-up, then a blow that breaks his guard."

msgid "Enemies ahead! Press {attack} to swing your weapon. Keep pressing to chain a combo of three swings — four with a weapon in each hand. The last swing of a combo staggers."
msgstr "Enemies ahead! Press {attack} to swing your weapon. Keep pressing to chain a combo of three swings — four with a weapon in each hand. The last swing of a combo staggers."

msgid "Press {heavy_attack} for a heavy attack: a slow wind-up, then a blow that breaks an enemy's guard and staggers it. A hit during the wind-up interrupts it, so pick your moment."
msgstr "Press {heavy_attack} for a heavy attack: a slow wind-up, then a blow that breaks an enemy's guard and staggers it. A hit during the wind-up interrupts it, so pick your moment."

msgid "Hold {block} to block: a hit from the front does no damage (a heavy blow or the last hit of a combo breaks the guard). When an enemy's weapon glints red, press {block} — that is a parry: no damage, and the attacker is staggered and open to a counter."
msgstr "Hold {block} to block: a hit from the front does no damage (a heavy blow or the last hit of a combo breaks the guard). When an enemy's weapon glints red, press {block} — that is a parry: no damage, and the attacker is staggered and open to a counter."

msgid "Defeated enemies leave XP and coins. The XP bar fills with each kill; when it is full you level up, gaining HP, damage and a skill point."
msgstr "Defeated enemies leave XP and coins. The XP bar fills with each kill; when it is full you level up, gaining HP, damage and a skill point."

msgid "Each level raises your HP and damage and gives a skill point. Spend points in the game menu under Skills."
msgstr "Each level raises your HP and damage and gives a skill point. Spend points in the game menu under Skills."

msgid "Level up! You can learn Healing Palm — press {game_menu}, open Skills, select it and confirm. It goes to your skill bar; press {skill_slot_1} to heal."
msgstr "Level up! You can learn Healing Palm — press {game_menu}, open Skills, select it and confirm. It goes to your skill bar; press {skill_slot_1} to heal."

msgid "Grandfather gave you a sword and armour — press {game_menu}, open Inventory and use them to equip, or choose a slot in Equipment."
msgstr "Grandfather gave you a sword and armour — press {game_menu}, open Inventory and use them to equip, or choose a slot in Equipment."

