msgstr "Companions fight at your side — press {assist} to call one. Call the guard now!"

msgid "Allies you meet can join your party: choose who goes with you in Status. {assist} calls the next ready companion."
msgstr "Allies you meet can join your party: choose who goes with you in Status. {assist} calls the next ready companion."

